.Dd August 17, 2026
.Dt bastille-plugin 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm bastille plugin
.Nd Run a custom Bastille plugin.
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm bastille plugin
.Ar PLUGIN COMMAND ARGS
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm bastille plugin
sub-command is used to bootstrap and run Bastille plugins.
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Bootstrap a plugin:
.Sy bastille plugin https://github.com/user/repo
.It Run a custom plugin called 'vm' with the command 'create':
.Sy bastille plugin vm create 
